<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-BARCELONA OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BARCELONA OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the Barcelona Open tennis tournament on Wednesday:</p>
<p>16-Cedric Pioline (France) beat Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>4-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Francisco Clavet (Spain) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat Julian Alonso (Spain) 6-3 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>Fernando Vicente (Spain) beat Jordi Burillo (Spain) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Christian Ruud (Norway) beat Don Johnson (U.S.) 6-4 7-6 (11-9)</p>
<p>8-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Francis Roig (Spain) 6-4 6-0</p>
<p>9-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Richard Fromberg (Australia) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Fernando Meligeni (Brazil) beat Gilbert Schaller (Austria) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat Carlos Costa (Spain) 6-2 6-0  </p>
<p>Marc Goellner (Germany) beat German Lopez (Spain) 6-7 (5-7) 6-4</p>
<p>7-6</p>
<p>(7-3)</p>
<p>Albert Costa (Spain) beat JUan Albert Viloca (Spain) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Albert Portas (Spain) beat Marcelo Rios (Chile) 7-5 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat 2-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) 3-6</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>6-3</p>
